lein.gov.uk/en/sites/93015]; The fort covers about 4 hectares. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bulwarks,_Porthkerry]; The site has been excavated. [SUPPORTED: https://coflein.gov.uk/en/sites/93015]; Excavations indicate the fort was held from the Iron Age. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bulwarks,_Porthkerry]; Occupation continued into Roman times. [SUPPORTED: https://coflein.gov.uk/en/sites/93015]"}]'::jsonb),
